  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a woman in a maternal or nurturing role feeding a man spaghetti while text overlays suggest he has participated in a political protest. The juxtaposition of the tender, domestic scene with the political act creates a humorous or ironic contrast. The intent appears to be to mock or trivialize political activism by framing it as childish or overly emotional, implying that protesting is a 'mommy' activity for 'big boys'. This can be seen as harmful because it undermines the seriousness of political engagement and may discourage participation by portraying it as immature or unworthy of adult political discourse. The meme does not target any specific protected group with hate or abuse, but it does use a stereotype of political activism as being associated with emotional or childish behavior, which can be demeaning to those who engage in protest. The overall intent is to satirize or belittle political protest through an analogy of domestic infantilization.",
